:4474.7,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SAATVIK_10102026182930_reg30greenorder.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**KEC International** — secures **new India T&D orders of Rs 1,014 crore**, including its first 765 kV line for evacuating power from a pumped storage plant; YTD intake is over Rs 9,600 crore _(~10.3% of mcap)_.","**Viviana Power Tech** — receives **turnkey contracts worth Rs 466.74 crore (incl. taxes) from Madhya Gujarat Vij Company** for covered-conductor and underground conversion of 11 kV lines, after its earlier L1 disclosure _(~56.4% of mcap)_.","**Hazoor Multi Projects** — wins two one-year **NHAI user-fee collection contracts of Rs 49.49 crore and Rs 28.10 crore** for three Karnataka fee plazas, **Rs 77.60 crore** together (our arithmetic) _(~16.6% of mcap)_.","**Saatvik Green Energy** — receives an **MSEDCL order for 5,000 off-grid solar water pumps worth about Rs 100 crore (excl. GST)**, with each installation due 60 days after a circle-office work order _(~2.0% of mcap)_.","**Siyaram Recycling Industries** — receives a **Rs 2.02 crore brass billet export order from Green Metals FZCO, Dubai**, for execution within seven days _(~2.8% of mcap)_.","**Zenith Drugs** — receives a Haryana Medical Services Corporation Letter of Acceptance to supply a cough syrup to state hospitals for two years at **Rs 11.15 a bottle** (contract value not disclosed).","**Mega Nirman and Industries** — signs a master agreement to install, own and run EV charging stations for Safexpress's logistics fleet, 10 years per site with minimum guaranteed consumption; no aggregate value is committed."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Maximus International** — board approves converting a **Rs 7.20 crore loan from promoter Optimus Finance into 48 lakh shares at Rs 15**, subject to approvals, and authorises buying industrial land near Vadodara for an export plant _(~3.5% of mcap)_.","**Deep Polymers** — board proposes **32 lakh warrants, up to Rs 3.20 crore**, to two promoters and 12 non-promoters, priced under SEBI rules and subject to an EGM _(~3.2% of mcap)_.","**Ecofinity Atomix** — cancels the September resolution for 23.90 lakh warrants (Rs 16.61 crore), none allotted, and instead proposes **15.87 lakh warrants, up to Rs 1.59 crore**, to 17 investors, subject to an EGM _(~3.2% of mcap)_."],"equity_allotments":["**Sheetal Universal** — converts 9 lakh **warrants issued earlier** into shares at Rs 210 for promoters Hiren and Kajal Patel and non-promoter Mona Shah, on receipt of the 75% balance (**Rs 14.18 crore**) _(~3.5% of mcap)_."],"m_and_a":["**Authum Investment & Infrastructure** — pays its **Rs 350 crore** share of the NCLT-approved Wind World (India) resolution plan with Inox Neo, and its Rs 100 crore deposit in Vibhav Energy converts into 25% of that company.","**Nimbus Projects** — its real-estate partnership IITL-Nimbus The Express Park View becomes a 95%-owned company, its Rs 1.02 crore capital converted to shares; the firm's FY26 turnover was Rs 220.29 crore.","**Heritage Foods** — pays for the further 5.60% of subsidiary Heritage Novandie Foods announced in July; the share transfer is in process (value not stated in this filing).","**Airfloa Rail Technology** — signs a non-binding MoU with China's KTK Group to bid jointly for platform screen door projects in India, with Airfloa making selected components locally (no value)."],"capex_core":["**Oswal Pumps** — subsidiary Oswal Solar Energy approves a **1.2 GW TOPCon solar cell plant at Karnal costing about Rs 456 crore** (Rs 296 crore debt, Rs 159.85 crore re-directed IPO money, subject to shareholders), producing from April 2028 for its own modules _(~15.7% of mcap)_."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 7 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Signatureglobal (India)** — Q2 FY27 pre-sales fall **9% YoY to Rs 18.3 billion** while collections rise 9% to Rs 10.1 billion; it added 194.22 acres at Farrukhnagar with about 6.77 million sq ft of potential.","**Fabtech Cleanrooms** — books **Rs 35.60 crore of orders in September**, Rs 28.26 crore of it HVAC systems, taking its consolidated order book to Rs 468.18 crore _(~6.3% of mcap)_.","**Inter State Oil Carrier** — handles **27.88 thousand tonnes in September, up 31.69% YoY** from 21.17 thousand, though 1.62% below August.","**Calcom Vision** — Q2 FY27 sales revenue of **Rs 66.30 crore**, which it calls its highest second quarter ever.","**Meesho** — its Mega Blockbuster Sale opens with **Day 1 orders up about 75% YoY**, peaking above 75,000 a minute, and transacting customers up about 60%.","**ADF Foods** — its US subsidiary agrees to accept **US$1.75 million plus interest** against judgments of about US$2.31 million from Ascot Valley Foods, with US$450,000 already received and Ascot dropping its appeal."],"distress_risk":["**Infosys** — the US Department of Labor suspends new and pending PERM labour-certification applications by companies including Infosys; it expects no material impact.","**Krishanveer Forge** — faces a civil suit claiming a one-third share of a Kharabwadi, Pune land parcel bought in 1991, valued by the plaintiffs at **Rs 4.60 crore**; it will contest _(~3.2% of mcap)_."],"credit_rating_changes":["**HP Adhesives** — CARE reaffirms BBB/A3+ and **removes it from Rating Watch with Negative Implications**, assigning a Stable outlook."],"other_notable":["**Sarda Energy & Minerals** — subsidiary Sarda Metals & Alloys is declared **preferred bidder** (not yet an award) for the Avagudem manganese block in Andhra Pradesh, with about 0.70 million tonnes of reserves."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","di